1
00:01:33,120 --> 00:01:38,100
[First Love Again]

2
00:01:38,420 --> 00:01:40,880
[Episode 12]

3
00:01:41,030 --> 00:01:43,100
[Police]

4
00:01:45,220 --> 00:01:49,560
[Police]

5
00:01:56,910 --> 00:01:59,930
[Police]

6
00:02:08,270 --> 00:02:10,669
[Political Judgment, Political Insight,
and Political Execution]

7
00:02:21,030 --> 00:02:22,750
Are you alright?

8
00:02:29,150 --> 00:02:30,470
You think this is funny?

9
00:02:30,470 --> 00:02:32,150
Can you act like a decent person?

10
00:02:32,150 --> 00:02:34,950
No, it's just that you look
kind of funny like this.

11
00:02:37,070 --> 00:02:39,210
Li Sirui, don't be mad.

12
00:02:40,590 --> 00:02:43,870
[Skewer Hot Pot]

13
00:02:41,430 --> 00:02:43,470
Li Sirui, don't be mad.

14
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:45,410
I'll buy you dinner.

15
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:47,750
Fine, you don't have to answer my calls.

16
00:02:47,750 --> 00:02:49,750
But why are you out drinking
with someone like that so late at night?

17
00:02:49,750 --> 00:02:51,520
If Xiangxiang hadn't told me
you were here,

18
00:02:51,520 --> 00:02:54,450
and if I'd arrived even a moment later,
you would've—

19
00:02:55,710 --> 00:02:56,470
Well...

20
00:02:56,960 --> 00:02:58,840
that's my business, isn't it?

21
00:02:59,750 --> 00:03:01,800
Why are you still saying things
you don't mean?

22
00:03:01,800 --> 00:03:03,560
I know I wronged you before.

23
00:03:04,280 --> 00:03:06,410
It's about time you forgave me, right?

24
00:03:06,590 --> 00:03:08,370
How exactly did you wrong me?

25
00:03:08,470 --> 00:03:10,130
-I...
-How come I didn't know?

26
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:15,190
I shouldn't have cheered for your opponent
at the sports meet.

27
00:03:15,190 --> 00:03:16,670
But seeing Zou Cheng cheer you on

28
00:03:16,670 --> 00:03:17,590
really got under my skin.

29
00:03:17,590 --> 00:03:18,870
I shouldn't have lied and said
the tickets to the water park

30
00:03:18,870 --> 00:03:19,710
were a gift from a fan.

31
00:03:19,710 --> 00:03:20,360
I spent half a month's living expenses

32
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:22,360
on those two tickets.

33
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:23,400
I shouldn't have challenged Fang Yu
to a drinking contest

34
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:24,630
and messed up your group project.

35
00:03:24,630 --> 00:03:26,510
But I was afraid he was
up to no good with you.

36
00:03:26,510 --> 00:03:27,540
And I definitely shouldn't have lied
during that Dragon Boat Festival

37
00:03:27,540 --> 00:03:28,680
truth-or-dare game,

38
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:30,280
saying I didn't feel the way
everyone thought I did.

39
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:33,010
The lie detector nearly
shocked me unconscious.

40
00:03:38,630 --> 00:03:39,360
Then why,

41
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:43,000
after I came to Jiangcheng
and we met in person,

42
00:03:43,030 --> 00:03:44,710
did you keep saying
you had no time to see me?

43
00:03:44,710 --> 00:03:46,150
-Wait—
-Were you disappointed

44
00:03:46,150 --> 00:03:46,840
when you saw me in person?

45
00:03:46,840 --> 00:03:47,570
-Wait—
-You—

46
00:03:47,750 --> 00:03:48,960
Didn't you fall for another guy

47
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:50,560
and practically stop talking to me?

48
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:51,710
I thought you were disappointed in me.

49
00:03:51,710 --> 00:03:52,520
You're just shifting the blame.

50
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:54,120
You were the one playing basketball
with another girl,

51
00:03:54,120 --> 00:03:54,960
okay?

52
00:04:03,400 --> 00:04:04,680
What's so funny?

53
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:10,030
Do you remember saying

54
00:04:10,630 --> 00:04:14,360
you wanted a new collectible figure
before you came to Jiangcheng?

55
00:04:15,750 --> 00:04:18,950
I was working as
a basketball training partner back then,

56
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:20,500
saving up to buy it for you.

57
00:04:29,310 --> 00:04:31,240
S-So

58
00:04:31,630 --> 00:04:35,290
we weren't online friends
who fell apart after meeting in person.

59
00:04:35,360 --> 00:04:37,000
You never disliked me.

60
00:04:37,240 --> 00:04:38,240
I never did.

61
00:04:38,240 --> 00:04:39,920
I've been waiting for you to reach out.

62
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:41,720
Even if you just wanted to pick a fight
or give me a hard time,

63
00:04:41,720 --> 00:04:43,560
as long as I could see you, I'd—

64
00:04:43,070 --> 00:04:45,700
♪ I love you ♪

65
00:04:46,340 --> 00:04:49,610
♪ I miss you ♪

66
00:04:50,340 --> 00:04:57,520
♪ The me who met you that day
belongs to long, long ago ♪

67
00:04:51,710 --> 00:04:53,659
[Late Night Restaurant, Open 24/7]

68
00:04:56,850 --> 00:05:00,350
[Late Night Restaurant, Open 24/7]

69
00:04:57,880 --> 00:05:01,110
♪ Across the sea of time ♪

70
00:05:01,380 --> 00:05:05,650
♪ Reunited,
love finds its sweetest scene ♪

71
00:05:07,510 --> 00:05:09,750
[Hello Summer]

72
00:05:17,630 --> 00:05:19,030
Is it for your boyfriend?

73
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:20,390
No.

74
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:22,560
If you're giving it to a guy,

75
00:05:22,870 --> 00:05:24,510
I'd recommend this purple one.

76
00:05:24,510 --> 00:05:27,830
[Hello Summer]

77
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:30,160
It's really nice.

78
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:32,830
Could you find a box
and wrap it up for me, please?

79
00:05:32,830 --> 00:05:33,430
Sure.

80
00:05:37,190 --> 00:05:39,920
Hope you'll accept my apology.

81
00:05:44,270 --> 00:05:46,400
All right, come on. Watch your passes.

82
00:05:46,750 --> 00:05:47,560
Hurry up!

83
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:48,920
Defense, defense!

84
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:51,360
Get the rebound!

85
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:52,159
Watch your form!

86
00:05:52,159 --> 00:05:53,340
Watch your passes!

87
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:54,720
Block him!

88
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:55,850
Get back on defense!

89
00:06:00,860 --> 00:06:01,420
Good.

90
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:04,560
Ms. Bai, honestly,

91
00:06:04,560 --> 00:06:07,360
Captain Gu is still our
most well-rounded player.

92
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:08,040
But after a period of training,

93
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:10,040
Li Sirui

94
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:12,160
has improved tremendously overall.

95
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:13,720
And Zhou Li and the others

96
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:15,070
-are some rising stars on the team.
-Stay on him!

97
00:06:15,070 --> 00:06:16,000
Their only real weakness

98
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:17,510
is that they're
still a little raw technically.

99
00:06:17,510 --> 00:06:20,440
Otherwise, they don't have
any major shortcomings.

100
00:06:22,040 --> 00:06:23,270
All right, take a break right here.

101
00:06:22,390 --> 00:06:24,200
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

102
00:06:24,800 --> 00:06:25,510
Ms. Bai.

103
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:26,680
Hello, Coach Pei.

104
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:28,720
You're really fired up today.

105
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:29,510
You bet.

106
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:32,190
Ms. Bai doesn't come
to watch us practice every day.

107
00:06:32,190 --> 00:06:33,430
Who's Ms. Bai?

108
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:36,190
Kid, you don't even know who Ms. Bai is?

109
00:06:36,190 --> 00:06:38,350
-She manages several professional players.
-I'm just here to take a look today.

110
00:06:38,350 --> 00:06:40,430
Some of them have appeared
on basketball variety shows,

111
00:06:40,430 --> 00:06:42,159
and Ms. Bai has discovered
many talented players.

112
00:06:42,159 --> 00:06:43,480
-I'll be counting on your guidance.
-Those basketball variety shows

113
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:45,040
were only good in the first season.

114
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:46,240
But what is she doing here?

115
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:48,370
It's all thanks to Hui's connections.

116
00:06:48,430 --> 00:06:51,090
Most people couldn't afford
to bring Ms. Bai in.

117
00:06:51,360 --> 00:06:53,070
All right, gather around!

118
00:06:53,750 --> 00:06:54,430
Let's go.

119
00:06:54,920 --> 00:06:56,720
Move a little faster back there.

120
00:06:57,800 --> 00:06:59,720
All right, let's give a warm welcome

121
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:02,050
to Ms. Bai,
who's here for a special visit.

122
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:04,480
Hello, everyone.

123
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:05,800
Ms. Bai,

124
00:07:06,270 --> 00:07:09,040
I need to prepare the materials
for the national tournament,

125
00:07:09,040 --> 00:07:09,560
so I'll leave things in your hands.

126
00:07:09,560 --> 00:07:10,690
Of course. Go ahead.

127
00:07:11,070 --> 00:07:12,870
Please look after Ms. Bai for me.

128
00:07:16,040 --> 00:07:19,310
Now, let's invite Ms. Bai
to say a few words.

129
00:07:19,910 --> 00:07:22,060
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

130
00:07:23,120 --> 00:07:24,510
Tang Hui has been telling me

131
00:07:24,510 --> 00:07:26,240
that JCU is full of hidden talent,

132
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:27,830
so she asked me to come take a look.

133
00:07:27,830 --> 00:07:28,800
I've also heard people say

134
00:07:28,800 --> 00:07:30,870
that JCU has gone downhill
since winning eight championships.

135
00:07:30,870 --> 00:07:32,870
But after watching you train today,

136
00:07:32,920 --> 00:07:34,380
I can see those rumors
couldn't be further from the truth.

137
00:07:34,380 --> 00:07:35,780
I should've come sooner.

138
00:07:36,390 --> 00:07:37,310
I also hope

139
00:07:37,310 --> 00:07:39,630
you can find time to come
to my club for a tryout.

140
00:07:39,630 --> 00:07:41,890
I look forward to working with all of you.

141
00:07:42,430 --> 00:07:42,870
Sounds great.

142
00:07:42,870 --> 00:07:44,400
We really need to work hard.

143
00:07:52,040 --> 00:07:53,570
So, this must be Captain Gu.

144
00:07:53,950 --> 00:07:54,480
He's Gu Han.

145
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:56,040
I've heard so much
about you from Tang Hui.

146
00:07:56,040 --> 00:07:57,290
She says you're incredibly talented

147
00:07:57,290 --> 00:07:59,140
and well-rounded.

148
00:07:59,430 --> 00:08:00,800
After watching you play today,

149
00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:02,270
I can see she's right.
You did really well.

150
00:08:02,270 --> 00:08:04,190
Let's have a chat sometime.

151
00:08:04,430 --> 00:08:05,560
Okay, thank you.

152
00:08:11,510 --> 00:08:12,750
All right, if there's nothing else,

153
00:08:12,750 --> 00:08:13,810
you're dismissed.

154
00:08:16,040 --> 00:08:16,680
Gu Han.

155
00:08:16,700 --> 00:08:18,270
Our team is pretty good.

156
00:08:18,270 --> 00:08:19,070
Got any water?

157
00:08:19,070 --> 00:08:19,430
Ms. Bai.

158
00:08:19,430 --> 00:08:19,830
Over there.

159
00:08:19,830 --> 00:08:21,040
I was wondering if you'd like

160
00:08:21,040 --> 00:08:22,500
to join us for a meal later.

161
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:24,720
Come on, Ms. Bai. You should join us.

162
00:08:24,720 --> 00:08:25,720
Since you're already here,

163
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:27,040
there's a great restaurant

164
00:08:27,040 --> 00:08:28,160
near our campus.

165
00:08:28,190 --> 00:08:29,520
You should give it a try.

166
00:08:29,750 --> 00:08:31,390
Then let's all go together.

167
00:08:31,510 --> 00:08:32,870
Sure, I'll book a table.

168
00:08:33,510 --> 00:08:34,240
Xiangxiang,

169
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:35,630
why don't you come with us?

170
00:08:35,630 --> 00:08:36,510
I heard today is your last day

171
00:08:36,510 --> 00:08:37,630
of filming.

172
00:08:38,440 --> 00:08:39,700
We'll sit this one out.

173
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:41,510
Why are you being so formal?

174
00:08:41,510 --> 00:08:42,120
Come on.

175
00:08:43,150 --> 00:08:44,000
You really don't have to.

176
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:45,910
Xiangxiang, let's go there too.

177
00:08:45,910 --> 00:08:47,510
A well-known agent is here
to scout players.

178
00:08:47,510 --> 00:08:48,670
This is great material for us.

179
00:08:48,670 --> 00:08:50,200
Let's go film some footage.

180
00:08:59,320 --> 00:09:01,360
Ms. Bai, we're a little short
on time today,

181
00:09:01,360 --> 00:09:03,120
so we'll have a simple meal
at a place near campus.

182
00:09:03,120 --> 00:09:04,960
It's the best restaurant around here.

183
00:09:04,960 --> 00:09:05,600
This looks pretty good.

184
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:08,120
You really don't have
to go to so much trouble.

185
00:09:08,120 --> 00:09:09,630
How about we all

186
00:09:09,630 --> 00:09:11,290
raise a glass to Ms. Bai first?

187
00:09:11,360 --> 00:09:12,510
Sure. To Ms. Bai.

188
00:09:13,630 --> 00:09:14,360
Gu Han.

189
00:09:18,720 --> 00:09:21,650
I'll finish mine.
Please drink as much as you'd like.

190
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:23,120
Ms. Bai,

191
00:09:23,910 --> 00:09:25,720
Gu Han is one of the best

192
00:09:25,720 --> 00:09:28,000
young players out there.

193
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:29,660
I hope you'll look out for him.

194
00:09:32,510 --> 00:09:34,510
Of course, the other members of our team,

195
00:09:34,510 --> 00:09:36,840
like Li Sirui and Chen Yu,

196
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:38,200
each have their own strengths.

197
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:39,670
I hope you'll
give them opportunities, too.

198
00:09:39,670 --> 00:09:40,930
Let me propose a toast.

199
00:09:41,200 --> 00:09:41,960
All right.

200
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:44,490
Ms. Bai, I'd like
to propose a toast to you too.

201
00:09:49,120 --> 00:09:49,850
Xiangxiang,

202
00:09:51,790 --> 00:09:53,050
are you still filming?

203
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:56,460
I'm checking
if there's any usable footage.

204
00:10:00,870 --> 00:10:02,930
All right, go ahead and do your thing.

205
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:03,600
Okay.

206
00:10:09,480 --> 00:10:11,410
Please drink as much as you'd like.

207
00:10:13,150 --> 00:10:15,440
So, what are your plans going forward?

208
00:10:16,550 --> 00:10:17,750
-I...
-Gu Han,

209
00:10:18,120 --> 00:10:19,250
what are your plans?

210
00:10:24,670 --> 00:10:27,030
No plans yet. I'll focus
on the national tournament first.

211
00:10:27,030 --> 00:10:28,200
An athlete's career

212
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:29,790
only lasts about a decade or so,

213
00:10:29,790 --> 00:10:31,960
and their prime is actually pretty short.

214
00:10:31,960 --> 00:10:34,490
So the sooner you start planning,
the better.

215
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:45,240
That's a good point.

216
00:10:45,240 --> 00:10:46,790
So, what kind of career path

217
00:10:46,790 --> 00:10:48,990
do you think would suit a player like me?

218
00:10:49,550 --> 00:10:50,390
I'll step out for a moment.

219
00:10:50,390 --> 00:10:51,360
I watched you train just now.

220
00:10:51,360 --> 00:10:51,750
Sure.

221
00:10:51,750 --> 00:10:53,150
You have a solid foundation,

222
00:10:53,150 --> 00:10:55,680
and you've got
the physical attributes, too.

223
00:11:19,080 --> 00:11:20,960
What's wrong? Upset?

224
00:11:23,390 --> 00:11:25,960
I know you don't like
these kinds of occasions,

225
00:11:25,960 --> 00:11:28,420
but it took a lot of effort
to get Bai Xue here.

226
00:11:28,670 --> 00:11:29,550
Besides,

227
00:11:29,960 --> 00:11:31,240
she has a point.

228
00:11:32,630 --> 00:11:34,120
The national tournament is coming up.

229
00:11:34,120 --> 00:11:36,580
Won't this affect everyone's performance?

230
00:11:36,960 --> 00:11:39,560
It's just one time.
Is it really that big a deal?

231
00:11:41,200 --> 00:11:43,270
Besides, building a good relationship
with Bai Xue

232
00:11:43,270 --> 00:11:44,720
could help the team members'

233
00:11:44,720 --> 00:11:45,720
future careers.

234
00:11:56,670 --> 00:11:57,390
Gu Han,

235
00:11:58,870 --> 00:11:59,630
do you really think Bai Xue

236
00:11:59,630 --> 00:12:01,830
came here today to scout the whole team?

237
00:12:02,720 --> 00:12:04,150
She's here for you.

238
00:12:05,750 --> 00:12:06,840
I've been telling her

239
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:08,150
how talented you are

240
00:12:08,150 --> 00:12:11,810
and that you'll definitely make it
into the professional league.

241
00:12:14,630 --> 00:12:15,960
I don't know why,
but ever since I came back,

242
00:12:15,960 --> 00:12:19,290
it feels like we've been growing
further and further apart.

243
00:12:23,750 --> 00:12:25,080
But trust me,

244
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:27,390
everything I've done

245
00:12:27,910 --> 00:12:29,370
has been for your own good.

246
00:12:38,750 --> 00:12:39,720
Gu Han...

247
00:12:45,440 --> 00:12:46,170
Xiangxiang.

248
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:52,790
Let's go.

249
00:12:55,030 --> 00:12:56,090
Don't be like this.

250
00:12:56,910 --> 00:12:57,670
Xiangxiang!

251
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:10,670
I've got you. Don't worry.

252
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:24,240
Breathe in, breathe out.
Breathe in, breathe out.

253
00:14:24,240 --> 00:14:26,300
Breathe in, breathe out. Breathe in.

254
00:14:28,510 --> 00:14:29,870
Why are you staring at me?

255
00:14:29,870 --> 00:14:32,000
What, do you want me to drink it for you?

256
00:14:38,790 --> 00:14:40,270
Have you had a girl

257
00:14:40,270 --> 00:14:42,790
you've really liked since you were little?

258
00:14:45,600 --> 00:14:46,440
Yeah.

259
00:14:47,320 --> 00:14:48,150
Who?

260
00:14:50,080 --> 00:14:50,910
You.

261
00:15:42,480 --> 00:15:44,240
Xiangxiang, what's wrong?

262
00:15:46,120 --> 00:15:47,320
I'm a little sleepy.

263
00:15:47,910 --> 00:15:48,970
I'm going to sleep.

264
00:15:52,440 --> 00:15:53,200
Stop asking.

265
00:15:55,870 --> 00:15:57,130
All right, break it up.

266
00:16:06,570 --> 00:16:08,810
[Jiangcheng University]

267
00:16:10,910 --> 00:16:11,550
Let's go.

268
00:16:13,550 --> 00:16:15,210
-Here. Let's sit here.
-Okay.

269
00:16:15,730 --> 00:16:16,510
-Morning, Gu Han.
-Gu Han.

270
00:16:16,510 --> 00:16:17,240
Morning.

271
00:16:17,320 --> 00:16:18,000
