318
00:19:02,440 --> 00:19:03,950
[By Popularity] [By Date]

319
00:19:03,240 --> 00:19:04,200
Liar!

320
00:19:04,200 --> 00:19:06,240
I bought an NQ concealer from her,

321
00:19:06,240 --> 00:19:08,480
and when I checked,
it turned out to be completely fake.

322
00:19:08,480 --> 00:19:10,110
It doesn't work at all.

323
00:19:10,270 --> 00:19:11,480
Same here.

324
00:19:11,480 --> 00:19:12,750
I bought a face mask,

325
00:19:12,750 --> 00:19:14,510
but the sheet was so rough

326
00:19:14,510 --> 00:19:16,200
it practically made my face wrinkle!

327
00:19:16,200 --> 00:19:17,590
And the shipping time, too!

328
00:19:17,590 --> 00:19:18,790
She promised it'd arrive in three days,

329
00:19:18,790 --> 00:19:20,550
but it took a whole week.

330
00:19:24,750 --> 00:19:26,480
Youyou always ships on the same day.

331
00:19:26,480 --> 00:19:28,110
She's kept that up for a whole year.

332
00:19:28,110 --> 00:19:30,200
Post your chat records and delivery dates

333
00:19:30,200 --> 00:19:31,400
for everyone to see.

334
00:19:32,750 --> 00:19:33,830
Exactly!

335
00:19:34,000 --> 00:19:35,680
How many times have I said this?

336
00:19:35,680 --> 00:19:37,000
If you've got proof,
show us your purchase records

337
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:38,350
and the product batch numbers.

338
00:19:38,350 --> 00:19:39,480
Talk is cheap.

339
00:19:39,830 --> 00:19:41,200
I checked NQ myself.

340
00:19:41,270 --> 00:19:43,070
Their face masks are supposed
to have slightly thicker sheets.

341
00:19:43,070 --> 00:19:45,330
You should've checked
or asked before buying.

342
00:19:45,330 --> 00:19:47,570
How can you blame the blogger for that?

343
00:19:51,070 --> 00:19:52,260
"Hello?"

344
00:19:54,070 --> 00:19:55,000
Who is this?

345
00:19:56,900 --> 00:19:58,750
[Jiangcheng University
Sports and Cultural Center]

346
00:19:58,860 --> 00:20:00,490
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

347
00:20:02,680 --> 00:20:03,830
Come on, come out.

348
00:20:09,960 --> 00:20:10,550
Come on.

349
00:20:13,440 --> 00:20:14,170
Xiangxiang.

350
00:20:14,400 --> 00:20:15,200
Xiangxiang.

351
00:20:15,640 --> 00:20:17,100
Xiangxiang, you're here.

352
00:20:18,180 --> 00:20:19,540
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

353
00:20:19,240 --> 00:20:21,110
Why did you leave dinner so early that day

354
00:20:21,110 --> 00:20:22,570
without saying anything?

355
00:20:22,720 --> 00:20:24,110
Something came up at the last minute.

356
00:20:24,110 --> 00:20:25,110
Sorry about that.

357
00:20:26,640 --> 00:20:28,720
Also, I also came

358
00:20:28,720 --> 00:20:30,880
to let you know that we've almost finished
editing the documentary.

359
00:20:30,880 --> 00:20:32,550
It'll be previewed
on the campus TV station tomorrow.

360
00:20:32,550 --> 00:20:33,830
The director asked me to invite you all

361
00:20:33,830 --> 00:20:35,270
to attend as guests

362
00:20:35,400 --> 00:20:36,480
and give us some feedback.

363
00:20:36,480 --> 00:20:37,510
Of course!

364
00:20:37,510 --> 00:20:38,510
You've all worked so hard on this.

365
00:20:38,510 --> 00:20:39,830
We have to show our support.

366
00:20:39,830 --> 00:20:41,310
Since it's about us anyway,

367
00:20:41,310 --> 00:20:42,550
let's go watch it together.

368
00:20:42,550 --> 00:20:43,880
I'll let everyone know.

369
00:20:46,000 --> 00:20:46,720
Gu Han.

370
00:20:51,510 --> 00:20:52,440
I'll pass.

371
00:20:52,920 --> 00:20:54,320
Tian and I already agreed

372
00:20:54,440 --> 00:20:55,720
to go over some game strategies.

373
00:20:55,720 --> 00:20:57,350
Xiangxiang has been working
on this for so long.

374
00:20:57,350 --> 00:20:58,880
Why not go watch it first
and work on game strategies afterward?

375
00:20:58,880 --> 00:20:59,480
Exactly.

376
00:20:59,480 --> 00:21:00,740
-Yeah!
-That's right.

377
00:21:01,400 --> 00:21:04,060
Can't help it.
I've already made plans with him.

378
00:21:08,310 --> 00:21:10,240
If you're going,
make sure you watch carefully

379
00:21:10,240 --> 00:21:12,170
and give them some feedback, okay?

380
00:21:12,310 --> 00:21:13,750
Come with us.

381
00:21:16,310 --> 00:21:17,350
It's a deal, then.

382
00:21:17,480 --> 00:21:18,480
See you tomorrow.

383
00:21:20,830 --> 00:21:21,720
Bye-bye!

384
00:21:22,240 --> 00:21:23,770
Bye-bye! See you tomorrow.

385
00:21:26,310 --> 00:21:28,040
All right, let's get back to it.

386
00:21:31,790 --> 00:21:33,110
How is it? Want anything else?

387
00:21:33,110 --> 00:21:34,510
Should we get some cheesecake

388
00:21:34,510 --> 00:21:36,310
or tiramisu to take back to the dorm?

389
00:21:36,310 --> 00:21:37,350
No, no.

390
00:21:37,640 --> 00:21:38,920
You're trying to make me fat.

391
00:21:38,920 --> 00:21:40,200
You're not fat at all!

392
00:21:40,200 --> 00:21:41,070
You don't have an ounce of fat on you!

393
00:21:41,070 --> 00:21:42,000
Where's the fat?

394
00:21:42,720 --> 00:21:44,030
All right, stop it!

395
00:21:44,030 --> 00:21:45,310
Everyone's watching.

396
00:21:46,750 --> 00:21:48,550
Didn't you say you had good news?

397
00:21:49,590 --> 00:21:52,310
The company I interviewed with got back
to me. I got the job!

398
00:21:52,310 --> 00:21:55,440
Guess how much I'll make per month
during my internship.

399
00:21:57,070 --> 00:21:57,880
Six thousand?

400
00:21:59,160 --> 00:22:00,160
Four thousand.

401
00:22:00,400 --> 00:22:02,530
You're that happy
over four thousand?

402
00:22:03,240 --> 00:22:06,570
Well, I can't exactly compare myself
to a rich girl like you.

403
00:22:07,410 --> 00:22:10,150
But if you start working,

404
00:22:10,270 --> 00:22:11,830
what about training and competitions?

405
00:22:11,830 --> 00:22:12,790
I'm almost a senior.

406
00:22:12,790 --> 00:22:15,070
I don't want to keep asking my family
for money.

407
00:22:15,070 --> 00:22:17,200
It's a good chance to earn some money,
so I'll take it.

408
00:22:17,200 --> 00:22:19,550
Besides, I can set my own schedule
during the internship,

409
00:22:19,550 --> 00:22:21,240
so I don't have to work
on-site every day.

410
00:22:21,240 --> 00:22:24,040
The only downside is
that it's too far from campus.

411
00:22:24,070 --> 00:22:26,240
So I'm thinking of renting a place

412
00:22:26,240 --> 00:22:28,640
somewhere between the company and campus.

413
00:22:33,750 --> 00:22:36,150
Well, as long as
you've thought it through.

414
00:22:37,070 --> 00:22:38,160
Come on,

415
00:22:38,250 --> 00:22:39,360
don't be like that.

416
00:22:39,880 --> 00:22:41,550
I'll come back to campus every day,

417
00:22:41,550 --> 00:22:43,160
and after practice, I'll take you out
for something delicious,

418
00:22:43,160 --> 00:22:43,790
okay?

419
00:22:46,350 --> 00:22:47,200
Forget it.

420
00:22:47,510 --> 00:22:50,200
I'll just go eat at the cafeteria
with Xiangxiang.

421
00:22:50,200 --> 00:22:52,200
She hasn't seemed herself lately.

422
00:22:52,830 --> 00:22:54,090
You noticed that, too?

423
00:22:55,400 --> 00:22:57,190
Are Tang Hui and Gu Han together?

424
00:22:57,190 --> 00:22:58,230
No way.

425
00:22:58,510 --> 00:23:01,000
Gu Han has always treated Hui
like a little sister.

426
00:23:01,000 --> 00:23:03,590
And Hui hasn't been
around the team much lately, either.

427
00:23:03,590 --> 00:23:06,000
Things have been kind of weird
between her and Gu Han, too.

428
00:23:06,000 --> 00:23:08,860
Is there something going on
that I don't know about?

429
00:23:12,620 --> 00:23:16,520
[JCU Campus TV Station]

430
00:23:16,920 --> 00:23:18,300
Mr. Zhang, I'll talk to the department

431
00:23:18,300 --> 00:23:19,430
about it later.

432
00:23:19,750 --> 00:23:20,660
Mr. Zhang, over here.

433
00:23:20,660 --> 00:23:21,380
Keep it up.

434
00:23:22,200 --> 00:23:22,640
Mr. Zhang.

435
00:23:22,640 --> 00:23:23,240
Have a seat.

436
00:23:22,910 --> 00:23:25,730
[Jiangcheng University Campus TV Station]

437
00:23:23,510 --> 00:23:24,270
Have a seat.

438
00:23:24,680 --> 00:23:25,240
Have a seat.

439
00:23:25,240 --> 00:23:25,960
Senior,

440
00:23:26,480 --> 00:23:27,480
I haven't had a chance

441
00:23:27,480 --> 00:23:29,610
to thank you for what you did last time.

442
00:23:30,370 --> 00:23:32,630
It's nothing. It was the least I could do.

443
00:23:34,030 --> 00:23:35,920
You've been working hard to finish
the documentary these past few days,

444
00:23:34,800 --> 00:23:37,700
[Jiangcheng University Campus TV Station]

445
00:23:36,030 --> 00:23:38,030
and you seem to be doing pretty well.

446
00:23:42,020 --> 00:23:43,750
Is the basketball team coming?

447
00:23:47,480 --> 00:23:49,720
All right, keep it up!

448
00:23:51,220 --> 00:23:53,540
[Jiangcheng University Campus TV Station]

449
00:23:55,750 --> 00:23:56,960
Hurry up, everyone.

450
00:23:56,960 --> 00:23:58,760
The screening's about to start.

451
00:23:58,790 --> 00:24:00,000
Go on, go ahead.

452
00:24:03,070 --> 00:24:04,070
Come on, let's go.

453
00:24:11,440 --> 00:24:12,900
You're really not coming?

454
00:24:15,240 --> 00:24:15,920
No.

455
00:24:16,680 --> 00:24:18,720
But Tian has something
to take care of at home later.

456
00:24:18,720 --> 00:24:19,640
Why did you lie?

457
00:24:25,640 --> 00:24:27,370
Did you two have another fight?

458
00:24:30,110 --> 00:24:32,310
I'm not interested in the documentary.

459
00:24:32,680 --> 00:24:33,920
Fine.

460
00:24:34,440 --> 00:24:35,370
Don't regret it.

461
00:24:47,980 --> 00:24:50,990
[Jiangcheng University Campus TV Station]

462
00:24:55,030 --> 00:24:56,590
Congratulations, Xiangxiang.

463
00:24:56,590 --> 00:24:57,720
Congrats, Xiangxiang.

464
00:24:57,720 --> 00:24:58,440
Thank you.

465
00:24:59,160 --> 00:25:00,220
Congratulations.

466
00:25:00,880 --> 00:25:02,210
Congrats, Xiangxiang.

467
00:25:03,160 --> 00:25:04,220
Congratulations.

468
00:25:04,640 --> 00:25:06,070
You've worked hard, Xiangxiang.

469
00:25:06,070 --> 00:25:07,300
-You've been filming us for so long.
-It was nothing.

470
00:25:07,300 --> 00:25:09,070
[Jiangcheng University Campus TV Station]

471
00:25:07,550 --> 00:25:09,680
Xiangxiang, did you make me
look handsome?

472
00:25:09,680 --> 00:25:11,010
Have a seat, have a seat.

473
00:25:12,030 --> 00:25:13,200
H-Handsome, right?

474
00:25:17,400 --> 00:25:19,330
Sorry I'm late. Practice ran over.

475
00:25:19,590 --> 00:25:20,240
It's okay.

476
00:25:21,890 --> 00:25:22,790
Hello, Xiangxiang.

477
00:25:22,030 --> 00:25:23,610
[Jiangcheng University Campus TV Station]

478
00:25:22,880 --> 00:25:23,740
Congratulations, Xiangxiang.

479
00:25:23,740 --> 00:25:24,370
Thank you.

480
00:25:27,400 --> 00:25:29,030
Gu Han is busy analyzing game strategies.

481
00:25:29,030 --> 00:25:31,630
He asked me
to wish you a successful screening.

482
00:25:32,160 --> 00:25:32,820
Have a seat.

483
00:25:32,920 --> 00:25:34,180
Looking forward to it.

484
00:25:46,550 --> 00:25:47,280
Xiangxiang,

485
00:25:48,720 --> 00:25:50,250
are we about ready to start?

486
00:26:05,280 --> 00:26:06,350
[Jiangcheng University Team]

487
00:26:09,750 --> 00:26:11,160
We'll head straight in shortly.

488
00:26:11,160 --> 00:26:11,960
Are you ready?

489
00:26:12,270 --> 00:26:13,330
You can start filming now.

490
00:26:13,330 --> 00:26:14,790
Come on, come on! Hurry up!

491
00:26:17,030 --> 00:26:18,090
What are you doing?

492
00:26:18,160 --> 00:26:19,940
Now, over to Zhou Xiangxiang.

493
00:26:19,970 --> 00:26:20,920
Start the interview.

494
00:26:20,920 --> 00:26:22,070
Are you crazy?

495
00:26:25,070 --> 00:26:26,270
This is so sudden!

496
00:26:28,270 --> 00:26:29,930
No, no, stop filming!

497
00:26:31,510 --> 00:26:32,920
Why didn't you tell us
there'd be an interview?

498
00:26:32,920 --> 00:26:34,920
Those biceps look pretty good, huh?

499
00:26:39,240 --> 00:26:40,750
Now, let's take a look

500
00:26:40,750 --> 00:26:43,080
at how the team
has been doing in training.

501
00:26:44,200 --> 00:26:45,590
Wang Hao, how do you feel?

502
00:26:45,590 --> 00:26:46,850
I'll be fine, for sure.

503
00:26:46,960 --> 00:26:47,880
Go, JCU!

504
00:26:49,640 --> 00:26:50,790
Zhou Li, are you tired?

505
00:26:50,790 --> 00:26:51,550
Not at all.

506
00:26:52,000 --> 00:26:52,920
I'm alright.

507
00:26:53,160 --> 00:26:54,110
No problem.

508
00:26:55,000 --> 00:26:56,640
Senior Kong, how do you feel?

509
00:27:03,790 --> 00:27:04,720
I'm good.

510
00:27:06,030 --> 00:27:06,750
Go, JCU!

511
00:27:09,830 --> 00:27:12,960
Looks like the team has made
great progress in training.

512
00:27:18,720 --> 00:27:19,310
Come on.

513
00:27:21,960 --> 00:27:22,880
For a long time,

514
00:27:22,880 --> 00:27:24,000
everyone thought

515
00:27:24,790 --> 00:27:27,250
I was carrying the basketball team
on my own.

516
00:27:27,790 --> 00:27:29,270
That I was leading the team

517
00:27:29,510 --> 00:27:31,240
in every game all by myself.

518
00:27:32,120 --> 00:27:34,140
I used to think so, too.

519
00:27:35,030 --> 00:27:37,590
And that's exactly

520
00:27:37,680 --> 00:27:40,680
why our performance hadn't improved
for three years.

521
00:27:41,200 --> 00:27:43,130
It was all because of my arrogance.

522
00:27:45,310 --> 00:27:46,240
But recently,

523
00:27:47,640 --> 00:27:48,750
I met someone.

524
00:27:50,390 --> 00:27:52,190
This person taught me patience,

525
00:27:53,310 --> 00:27:54,400
helped me grow,

526
00:27:55,480 --> 00:27:58,410
and made me
take the people around me more seriously.

527
00:27:59,160 --> 00:28:00,490
Because of this person,

528
00:28:01,030 --> 00:28:03,890
I've become a little different
from who I used to be.

529
00:28:07,200 --> 00:28:08,200
Hello, Gu Han.

530
00:28:08,350 --> 00:28:10,480
We all know how crucial this game is.

531
00:28:10,480 --> 00:28:11,880
It's a do-or-die match.

532
00:28:12,030 --> 00:28:13,240
How do you feel about it?

533
00:28:13,240 --> 00:28:14,680
We have to win.

534
00:28:14,880 --> 00:28:16,440
Because we're JCU.

535
00:28:16,440 --> 00:28:18,180
-Good!
-Good!

536
00:28:18,200 --> 00:28:19,400
-Good!
-Good!

537
00:28:22,830 --> 00:28:23,750
Nice shot!

538
00:28:24,000 --> 00:28:24,880
-Nice!
-Nice!

539
00:28:24,880 --> 00:28:25,590
Nice shot.

540
00:28:31,510 --> 00:28:33,930
-JCU!
-JCU!

541
00:28:33,960 --> 00:28:36,430
-JCU!
-JCU!

542
00:28:36,460 --> 00:28:38,830
-JCU!
