596
00:31:03,310 --> 00:31:05,000
for a housewarming party.

597
00:31:05,000 --> 00:31:08,030
But Gu Han said he had something to do
and couldn't make it,

598
00:31:08,030 --> 00:31:10,400
and Kong Fang said
his parents were visiting.

599
00:31:10,400 --> 00:31:12,510
So Chen Yu is the only one left.

600
00:31:14,680 --> 00:31:16,590
I wasn't going to go either,

601
00:31:16,640 --> 00:31:18,400
but he kept bugging me.

602
00:31:19,070 --> 00:31:20,110
How about

603
00:31:20,440 --> 00:31:21,960
