604
00:31:21,960 --> 00:31:23,480
I'll pass. You go ahead.

605
00:31:24,070 --> 00:31:25,350
I'm not going either.

606
00:31:25,550 --> 00:31:26,950
I have something to do...

607
00:31:27,030 --> 00:31:29,030
There won't be enough people.
It won't be fun.

608
00:31:29,030 --> 00:31:30,030
I'm out, too.

609
00:31:37,270 --> 00:31:38,870
Then I guess I'll reject him.

610
00:31:39,000 --> 00:31:39,880
Besides,

611
00:31:40,240 --> 00:31:42,510
it's not like we're that close anyway.

612
00:31:45,510 --> 00:31:47,770
Are you sure Chen Yu
is the only one going?

613
00:31:47,880 --> 00:31:50,070
Of course. He told me himself.

614
00:32:01,640 --> 00:32:03,200
I'll return my books at the library,

615
00:32:03,200 --> 00:32:04,510
