616
00:32:04,510 --> 00:32:06,310
Remember to send me the address.

617
00:32:07,110 --> 00:32:08,570
Then shall we go together?

618
00:32:08,830 --> 00:32:09,750
Sure, I can go.

619
00:32:10,480 --> 00:32:11,720
I really do have something to do,

620
00:32:11,720 --> 00:32:13,050
