621
00:32:13,550 --> 00:32:14,440
See you guys.

622
00:32:30,270 --> 00:32:31,920
We've already started tidying up.

623
00:32:31,920 --> 00:32:33,720
Could you go to the supermarket

624
00:32:33,720 --> 00:32:34,960
