and pick up a few things for me?

625
00:32:34,960 --> 00:32:36,510
Just get what's on the list.

626
00:32:36,590 --> 00:32:37,310
Mwah!

627
00:32:39,030 --> 00:32:39,830
Got it.

628
00:32:53,350 --> 00:32:54,270
I'm sorry.

629
00:32:54,480 --> 00:32:55,880
-It's okay.
-No worries.

630
00:33:02,000 --> 00:33:03,930
What's going on, Zhou Xiangxiang?

631
00:33:04,110 --> 00:33:05,350
It's just Gu Han.

632
00:33:05,350 --> 00:33:06,950
You still can't get over him?

633
00:33:12,350 --> 00:33:14,680
A whole case of cola.

634
00:33:25,640 --> 00:33:27,720
A whole case of beer.

635
